{"reviewId": "15255006_84d8SDnE1", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "美国发起贸易战的核心是要你如此庞大的制造国所制造出的商品无处可去，最终内部消化造成极致内卷最后形成经济萎缩，而经济萎缩则会带来方方面面的矛盾，形成各种恶性循环", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "17404-17449", "abstract": "中国制造多少商品，很大意义上不再由中国自身决定（这意味着中国宏观调控政策的失效），而是由消", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8, "chapterName": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "chapterIdx": 8, "reviewId": "15255006_84d8SDnE1", "userVid": 15255006, "topics": [], "createTime": 1761553843, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "author": {"userVid": 15255006, "name": "Lee", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/WaLAJ9knia1JGyZVpt7HmtKoh41InQXlWzCtib8cXibcoqSbGveDx63JdQQSRobf1Koo8yNiapxPiao4/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "Lee", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "一篇读罢头飞雪", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 15, "likes": [{"userVid": 298385132, "name": "是谁在敲打我的窗", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0029-DuLXPMKWQorr4fCYeOeakf6/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "是谁在敲打我的窗", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "相信什么便成为什么", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}], "commentsCount": 3, "hotComments": [{"content": "你有没有想过，美国可能已经吃不下这么多商品了。美国要维持美元的稳定，就不能发太多美债，消减债务就没钱消费。", "reviewId": "15255006_84d8SDnE1", "commentId": "15255006_84d8SDnE1_c66920859_84eY3Q